So[ why the] RSP[CA]? Well, it’s a charity that�[�]s been close to my heart since I was as young as 3 – when my first cat came into my life in the shape of an RSPCA rescue tabby called Amber. He lived with us until the grand old age of 18 and I have since had[ two] more pet cats –[ both] adopted from the charity. No pet owner needs to be told the value of having an animal in your life, and I’m a very strong advocate of adopting animals in need rather than[ buying] them. I was also an active member of the Junior RSPCA squad as a kid, and was about[ as] animal obsessed as you can get.
